## 6. How to Run the Platform

### 1. Execute Unit & Integration Tests
```bash
python -m pytest -v
```

### 2. Run the End-to-End CLI Pipeline
```bash
python main_pipeline.py --video data/sample_videos/sample_road.mp4
```

### 3. Run Self-Test Modules
```bash
# Test PCI Engine
python -m vision.pci_engine

# Test Video Detector
python -m vision.detector

# Train / Evaluate RL Policy
python -m rl_engine.train --eval-only
```

### 4. Launch the FastAPI Microservice
```bash
uvicorn api.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload
```
- Interactive Swagger API Documentation: `http://localhost:8000/docs`

### 5. Launch the Streamlit Web Dashboard
```bash
streamlit run dashboard/app.py
```
- Web Application URL: `http://localhost:8501`

